<h2>1. Data controller</h2>
<p>[Legal name pending] is the controller of the personal data collected through QR Menu. For any questions about this policy, you can write to [contact email pending].</p>

<h2>2. What data we collect</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Your account data:</strong> email and password (stored encrypted, never in plain text) and your restaurant's name.</li>
    <li><strong>Your menu data:</strong> categories, dishes, prices, descriptions and images you upload for your digital menu.</li>
    <li><strong>Usage data of your public menu:</strong> which dishes are viewed, so we can show you statistics about your own menu.</li>
    <li><strong>Interactions with the Smart Waiter assistant:</strong> we record that a conversation took place and its language, for aggregated statistical purposes. We do not store the content of the messages your customers write.</li>
</ul>

